    "detailed_description": "One day, all of a sudden, you find yourself becoming a ghost.<br>You've never committed any evil. Your soul would surely be judged favorably.<br><br>It no longer mattered how great of a place it was.<br>The thought of being separated from him sounded more terrifying than purgatory.<br><br>You know what you need to do...<br><br>If you can't visit him anymore...<br>Then you have to bring him with you!<br>You're sure he would understand.<br>You need to bring him to your side before your spirit passes on.<br><br>You have to XXXX your beloved...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the System </h2>This is a point-and-click, command-selection style adventure game where the protagonist is a girl who has become a ghost.<br>The objective is to fulfill her desires by speaking to her beloved &quot;him,&quot; causing poltergeists, visiting in dreams, or even cursing.<br>However, as a ghost, you cannot easily communicate with &quot;him,&quot; who has no spiritual awareness. Through trial and error, try to bring about the desired outcome.<br>The main story has six different endings, with each playthrough taking about 15 minutes. The story changes based on your choices and actions.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additional Features from the Classic Version </h2><br>- Prologue Added: A prologue has been included that tells the story of your life before becoming a ghost.<br>- Menu Commands Added: Features like saving and an ending list have been added, making gameplay more user-friendly.<br>- Clear Bonuses Added: As a reward for clearing the game, an illustration gallery is now available. It also includes trivia and design materials.<br>- Sound Added: New music tracks and sound effects have been added by the artist of the main theme. Additionally, a soundtrack release is planned, so enjoy the wonderful music!",
